#. Scene label
#. screens: end_screen.tscn
msgid ""
"You did it! I'm proud of you! I hope you had fun.\n"
"\n"
"However I am very sorry that this is such a boring and uninspired win "
"screen. You deserve better and you will get better - in the full release.\n"
"\n"
"In the meantime, enjoy trying some of the harder difficulties, go spend "
"those Beanz on some upgrades and try out some different builds.\n"
"\n"
"If you had fun during this demo be sure to give it a wishlist or follow on "
"Steam - there's so much more to come!"
msgstr ""
"Uspjeli ste! Ponosan sam na vas! Nadam se da ste se zabavili.\n"
"\n"
"Međutim, jako mi je žao što je ovo tako dosadan i neinspirativan ekran za "
"pobjedu. Zaslužujete bolje i bit ćete bolji - u punom izdanju.\n"
"\n"
"U međuvremenu, uživajte u isprobavanju nekih težih razina, potrošite Beanz "
"na neke nadogradnje i isprobajte neke različite opreme i taktike.\n"
"\n"
"Ako ste se zabavili tijekom ove demo verzije, svakako je dodajte na listu "
"želja ili pratite na Steamu - bit će još puno toga!"

